      "Original": " minutes.",
      "Translated": "分钟后成为必需项。",
      "Context": "LodestoneVerifyWindow.DrawVerification",
      "Source": "ai:deepseek"
    },
    {
      "Original": "This verification will become a requirement in less than 5 minutes.",
      "Translated": "此验证将在 5 分钟内成为必需项。",
